确实是对粉丝来说没啥营养的访谈呢</description><link>https://bbs.yamibo.com/forum.php?mod=redirect&amp;goto=findpost&amp;ptid=541914&amp;pid=40898638</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://bbs.yamibo.com/forum.php?mod=redirect&amp;goto=findpost&amp;ptid=541914&amp;pid=40898638</guid><pubDate>Fri, 22 Dec 2023 04:36:00 GMT</pubDate><route><provider_id>yamibo</provider_id><provider_name>百合会</provider_name><route_path>/bbs/thread/:tid</route_path><route_name>BBS - 讨论串</route_name></route></item><item><title>2 - akibawara</title><description>
